Package: spCVAudit
Title: Audit Spatial Cross-Validation Against Prediction Targets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Olatunji", "Johnson",
    email = "olatunjijohnson21111@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compare spatial cross-validation designs with a declared prediction
    target using nearest-neighbour distances and correlation contrasts. Supports
    weighted targets, explicit fold validation, selection among candidate schemes,
    covariance estimation, and Gaussian reference calculations that separate the
    contribution of the nearest observation from that of the other observations.
    These diagnostics assess differences in prediction conditions; they do not
    establish data leakage or guarantee accurate prediction-error estimation.
